{
  "name": "N35-device-fails-while-silent",
  "about": "N35: the in-source mic fails while it is silent: its stretch closes at the failure, later mic silence is ignored, system silence is then 'no audio'. A duplicate changes nothing and an over-long reason is refused by the parser. The meeting records the device failure (dev:) apart from silent spans.",
